  - m_Id: 2986946636
    m_Localized: "\u7A7A\u767D\u683C\uFF0C\u65E0\u7279\u6B8A\u6548\u679C"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946637
    m_Localized: "\u4E8B\u4EF6\u683C\uFF0C\u53EF\u89E6\u53D1\u968F\u673A\u4E8B\u4EF6"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946638
    m_Localized: "\u70B9\u51FB\u4EFB\u610F\u683C\u5B50\u67E5\u770B\u8BE6\u60C5\u3002"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946639
    m_Localized: "\u672A\u9009\u4E2D\u683C\u5B50"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946640
    m_Localized: "\u533A\u57DF {value}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 5043701850270335002
  - m_Id: 2986946641
    m_Localized: "\u672A\u63A2\u7D22"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946642
    m_Localized: "\u672A\u89E3\u51B3"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946643
    m_Localized: "\u91D1\u5E01"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946644
    m_Localized: "\u6218\u6597\u6559\u7A0B"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946645
    m_Localized: "\u7A33\u5B9A\u800C\u6709\u529B\u7684\u57FA\u7840\u653B\u51FB\u3002\u5A01\u529B\u8303\u56F4\u9AD8\u4E8E\u8F7B\u51FB\uFF0C\u9002\u5408\u7B2C\u4E00\u6B21\u5B66\u4E60\u62FC\u70B9\u3002"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946646
    m_Localized: "\u91CD\u51FB"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946647
    m_Localized: "\u57FA\u7840\u653B\u51FB\u3002\u7528\u6765\u6F14\u793A\u654C\u65B9\u5355\u65B9\u9762\u653B\u51FB\u4E0E\u62FC\u70B9\u3002"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946648
    m_Localized: "\u8F7B\u51FB"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946649
    m_Localized: "\u7528\u4E8E\u7B2C\u4E00\u573A\u6559\u5B66\u6218\u7684\u4F4E\u5A01\u80C1\u654C\u4EBA\uFF0C\u53EA\u4F1A\u4F7F\u7528\u8F7B\u51FB\u3002"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946650
    m_Localized: "\u6728\u6869\u9F20"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946651
    m_Localized: "我方角色的威力范围更高，这意味着这次拼点非常稳定。\n在攻击骰子拼点中，胜利的一方会摧毁失败方的骰子，并打出自己骰子的伤害。\n拼点可以化解对手攻击，也可能让你失去进攻机会。"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946652
    m_Localized: "\u8FD9\u5C31\u662F\u62FC\u70B9"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946653
    m_Localized: "左侧列出了该角色拥有的技能，右侧面板会显示当前技能的详细信息。\n了解技能后，关闭技能面板。\n拖拽友方角色的速度按钮，把目标指定到敌人的速度按钮上。"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946654
    m_Localized: "\u6307\u5B9A\u653B\u51FB\u76EE\u6807"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946655
    m_Localized: "\u654C\u4EBA\u521A\u624D\u5BF9\u53CB\u65B9\u89D2\u8272\u9020\u6210\u4E86\u4F24\u5BB3\u3002\u4F24\u5BB3\u53D6\u51B3\u4E8E\u9AB0\u5B50\u7684\u5A01\u529B\uFF0C\u5A01\u529B\u8D8A\u9AD8\uFF0C\u4F24\u5BB3\u8D8A\u9AD8\u3002"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946656
    m_Localized: "单方面攻击"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946657
    m_Localized: "接下来是激动人心的战斗内容！\n先点击敌人的本体，查看当前敌人的基础信息。"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946658
    m_Localized: "\u7B2C\u4E00\u573A\u6218\u6597"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946659
    m_Localized: "你已经了解了当前敌人的基础信息，接下来准备开始战斗。\n点击屏幕下方的准备按钮。"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946660
    m_Localized: "\u51C6\u5907\u5F00\u59CB\u6218\u6597"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946661
    m_Localized: "敌人头顶的六边形按钮是它的速度按钮，也是技能槽，按钮上方的数字代表速度。\n现在点击敌人的速度按钮，查看它准备用什么技能。"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946662
    m_Localized: "\u8BFB\u53D6\u654C\u4EBA\u7684\u884C\u52A8"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946663
    m_Localized: "如果敌人的攻击线和友方角色的攻击线正好对上，线会变成黄色，这意味着双方将展开一次拼点。\n现在万事俱备，点击准备按钮进行结算。"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946664
    m_Localized: "拼点"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946665
    m_Localized: "敌人的技能会由若干颗骰子组成。\n“1 - 2” 这样的数值范围叫做威力范围，代表结算时威力会在 1 到 2 之间随机。\n现在关闭技能面板，再点击准备按钮。"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946666
    m_Localized: "敌人的攻击"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946667
    m_Localized: "你已经了解了基础战斗玩法！"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946668
    m_Localized: "\u606D\u559C\u4F60\uFF01"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946669
    m_Localized: "我们不能这样坐以待毙！展开有效反击来化解敌人的攻击！\n点击友方角色的速度按钮，查看我们有什么技能可以使用。"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946670
    m_Localized: "反击"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946671
    m_Localized: "\u660E\u767D\u4E86"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946672
    m_Localized: "这里显示了你当前的行动点，移动会消耗你的行动点。"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946673
    m_Localized: "\u884C\u52A8\u70B9"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946674
    m_Localized: "由于当前是“战斗格”，剩余的信息是战斗格特有的内容。\n敌人属性记录驻扎在当前格子敌人的属性。"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946675
    m_Localized: "\u654C\u4EBA\u5C5E\u6027"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946676
    m_Localized: "点击右侧战斗格，进入你的第一场战斗吧！"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946677
    m_Localized: "进入战斗"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946678
    m_Localized: "\u5730\u56FE\u63A2\u7D22"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946679
    m_Localized: "第一行包括格子的类型。例如 “战斗” 代表你会在进入该格子时开启一场战斗。"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946680
    m_Localized: "\u5750\u6807\u4E0E\u7C7B\u578B"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946681
    m_Localized: "通常探索一个新的格子需要消耗 2 行动点，而移动到已探索的格子只需要 1 行动点。"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946682
    m_Localized: "\u79FB\u52A8\u6D88\u8017"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946683
    m_Localized: "危险度记录当前格子敌人的危险程度。\n越靠近 Boss，区域越深入，敌人的危险度也会逐渐增加。\n时刻注意观察危险度，否则你可能会败在危险程度远高于你当前能力的敌人手下！"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946684
    m_Localized: "\u5371\u9669\u5EA6\u4E0E\u533A\u57DF"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946685
    m_Localized: "\u7B2C\u4E8C\u884C\u6807\u5FD7\u7740\u683C\u5B50\u7684\u63A2\u7D22\u60C5\u51B5\u3002\u5F53\u4F60\u8FDB\u5165\u4E00\u4E2A\u683C\u5B50\u5E76\u5B8C\u6210\u5185\u5BB9\u540E\uFF0C\u683C\u5B50\u5C06\u4F1A\u88AB\u63A2\u7D22\u5E76\u89E3\u51B3\u3002"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946686
    m_Localized: "\u63A2\u7D22\u72B6\u6001"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946687
    m_Localized: "\u8BF7\u70B9\u51FB\u53F3\u4FA7\u6218\u6597\u683C\u8FDB\u5165\u6559\u7A0B\u6218\u6597\u3002"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946688
    m_Localized: "\u5F00\u59CB\u89C2\u5BDF"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946689
    m_Localized: "金闪闪的金币！你可以用金币购买你需要的资源。"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946690
    m_Localized: "\u91D1\u5E01"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946691
    m_Localized: "\u70B9\u51FB\u4EFB\u610F\u4E00\u4E2A\u5730\u56FE\u683C\u5B50\u53EF\u4EE5\u67E5\u770B\u8BE5\u683C\u5B50\u7684\u8BE6\u60C5\u3002"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946692
    m_Localized: "\u67E5\u770B\u683C\u5B50\u8BE6\u60C5"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946693
    m_Localized: "\u8BF7\u70B9\u51FB\u53F3\u4FA7\u7684\u6218\u6597\u683C\u67E5\u770B\u8BE6\u60C5\u3002"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946694
    m_Localized: "\u8FD9\u6B21\u6559\u7A0B\u4F1A\u6CBF\u4E00\u6761\u56FA\u5B9A\u7684
      6 \u683C\u8DEF\u7EBF\u63A8\u8FDB\uFF1A\u5148\u5B8C\u6210\u4E24\u573A\u57FA\u7840\u6218\u6597\uFF0C\u518D\u5230\u5546\u5E97\u8D2D\u4E70\u56FE\u7EB8\u548C\u6750\u6599\uFF0C\u968F\u540E\u5728\u953B\u9020\u683C\u5236\u4F5C\u6B66\u5668\uFF0C\u6700\u540E\u6311\u6218\u7CBE\u82F1\u7EC8\u6218\u3002\n\n\u5148\u628A\u6BCF\u4E2A\u683C\u5B50\u7684\u8BE6\u60C5\u770B\u6E05\u695A\uFF0C\u518D\u51B3\u5B9A\u8FDB\u5165\u4E0B\u4E00\u683C\u3002"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946695
    m_Localized: "\u6559\u7A0B\u8DEF\u7EBF"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946696
    m_Localized: "\u6559\u7A0B\u5DF2\u5F00\u59CB\uFF1A\u5148\u70B9\u51FB\u76F8\u90BB\u683C\u5B50\u67E5\u770B\u8BE6\u60C5\uFF0C\u518D\u6B21\u70B9\u51FB\u5373\u53EF\u6CBF\u56FA\u5B9A\u8DEF\u7EBF\u63A8\u8FDB\u3002"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946697
    m_Localized: "仔细观察格子详情是通关游戏的一大秘籍！"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946698
    m_Localized: "\u683C\u5B50\u8BE6\u60C5"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946699
    m_Localized: "这里是地图页面。\n试着拖动画面、滚动鼠标滚轮，或用双指缩放来观察地图吧！"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946700
    m_Localized: "\u6B22\u8FCE\u6765\u5230\u9AB0\u63B7\u5927\u9646"
